    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "CB523A60EF7A8FC6",
      "text": "Honnêtement, j’suis surtout venu pour toi, mais\\nje t’avoue que je m’attendais pas à ce que\\r\\nl’Institut Myrtille soit aussi bluffant ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "CB523B60EF7A9179",
      "text": "Et il paraît que leurs cours portent davantage\\nsur les combats. C’est comme si nous, on avait\\r\\ncours toute la journée avec madame Élige ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "CB523860EF7A8C60",
      "text": "Je parie que Menzi serait folle de joie, ici.\\c\\nPerso, j’avoue que je suis plus intéressé par\\ndes trucs utiles comme l’éducation domestique...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "CB523960EF7A8E13",
      "text": "Tu préfères quoi, toi ? Les cours de combat\\nou l’éducation domestique ?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "95CEA937E1C91388",
      "text": "Les cours de combat !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "95CEAC37E1C918A1",
      "text": "L’éducation domestique !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "CB523E60EF7A9692",
      "text": "J’avais zappé que t’étais passé[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e Maître[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0300)]sse. T’es\\ndevenu[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e super fort[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e, t’as même battu Menzi.\\r\\nPas étonnant que tu préfères les combats.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0300"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
